You are writing an analytics module that many components import. The requirements are:

- one queue for the whole app;
- send a batch when 20 events are queued or 5 seconds after the oldest unsent event, whichever comes first;
- events tracked while a request is in flight must not be lost.

`send(batch)` posts a batch and returns a promise. Which module meets every requirement?

options.text:
```js
const queue = [];
let timer = null;

export function track(event) {
  queue.push({ ...event, ts: Date.now() });
  if (queue.length >= 20) flush();
  else if (!timer) timer = setTimeout(flush, 5000);
}

function flush() {
  clearTimeout(timer);
  timer = null;
  if (queue.length) send(queue.splice(0));
}
```

```js
